<?php
// output-S53 namespaced_strict unit — member A (fixture contract, see
// ../README.md): strict_types + typed shared formals ($user, $score) that
// S49b promotes through apply; the 'high'/'low' literal inside the matched
// render() call is the required hole whose per-member row S45 re-binds at
// the rewritten call site; keepMe is the S46 sibling survivor (and, per the
// disclosed multi-cluster range-shift law, a SECOND cluster this suite
// deliberately never applies). The delegation must be \Refactored\...
// FULLY QUALIFIED — S47 (a relative name resolves under App\Ledger and
